###
### MESSAGES ENDPOINTS
###

### GET messages by conversation ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1/messages

### POST create message (incoming)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "in",
  "type": "text",
  "payload": "Hola, necesito ayuda"
}

### POST create message (outgoing)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "out",
  "type": "text",
  "payload": "Hola! ¿En qué puedo ayudarte?"
}

### POST create message (image)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "out",
  "type": "image",
  "payload": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}

### POST create message (document)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "out",
  "type": "document",
  "payload": "https://example.com/document.pdf"
}

